window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>It only takes one moment to change the course of someone’s life. One moment to link two souls forever. That moment came when I pulled her out of her darkest hour. The tragedy that threatened to swallow her whole and shatter her innocence. <br> <br> Save her. <br> Protect her. <br> Love her. <br> I vowed. <br> <br> Ten years later, my vows are the same. <br> <br> But I’m different <br> She’s different <br> We’re different. <br> <br> And the feelings threatening to break free have the power to destroy everything. <br> <br> I’ll stop at nothing to keep her safe, but what if the very thing she needs protection from...is me?</p>"; 
